        <mxCell id="18" value="&lt;b&gt;Logical notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• MAP_TILESET_REF exists logically even though JSON stores tilesets inline; it explains many-to-many &amp; ordering.&lt;br/&gt;• EVENT_COMMAND uses an Index so the sequence is deterministic.&lt;br/&gt;• Tiles[int] is stored as a flat array; index = y*Width + x." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1">
